  "title": {
    "zh": "档案卷轴倒带",
    "en": "Archive Spool Release"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "连取四卷、反序验封",
    "en": "Four archive reels and reverse seal checks"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "收齐 oak、reed、pine、elm 四卷档案并到出口。归档单按这四个名称排列，seals 字典列出封签。验收机按归档单的倒序接收封签，每个提交的值都须从同一个栈顶弹出。 限 33 回合，避开巡逻。scan() 列出巡线、目标坐标和 compass 方向表。第二张地图将图纸旋转半圈。",
    "en": "Recover the four archive reels oak, reed, pine and elm and reach the exit. The archive manifest lists them in that order, and seals gives their seal codes. Submit the codes in reverse manifest order, popping every submitted value from the same stack. Avoid patrols within 33 turns. scan() lists patrol cycles, goal locations and the compass for plan directions. The second map rotates the plan by 180 degrees."
  },
